        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Even if we develop or acquire a promising new product that has been cleared for commercial distribution by the FDA, demand for the product may be limited unless our customers are reimbursed at favorable rates by private health insurers and government healthcare programs.",
        "start_character": 53278,
        "end_character": 53549
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001464521-26-000042",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001464521-26-000042-e76fb86f52c94263",
        "accession_number": "0001464521-26-000042",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-18",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "However, we can provide no assurance that we are or will always remain in compliance with diverse and changing privacy, security, and breach notification requirements in all of the jurisdictions in which we do business.",
        "start_character": 107457,
        "end_character": 107676
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001464521-26-000042",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001464521-26-000042-e76fb86f52c94263",
        "accession_number": "0001464521-26-000042",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-18",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "To date, we have developed three software products (with a fourth product expected to launch in the second quarter of 2026) under the Heartflow Platform that provide physicians with the critical insights needed to effectively diagnose and manage CAD:",
        "start_character": 7043,
        "end_character": 7293
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001464521-26-000042",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001464521-26-000042-e76fb86f52c94263",
        "accession_number": "0001464521-26-000042",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-18",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also rely upon trademarks to build and maintain the integrity and identity of our brand, and we seek to protect the confidentiality of trade secrets that may be important to the development of our business, especially where we do not believe patent protection is appropriate or obtainable.",
        "start_character": 58078,
        "end_character": 58370
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001464521-26-000042",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001464521-26-000042-e76fb86f52c94263",
        "accession_number": "0001464521-26-000042",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-18",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "As a manufacturer, we are subject to periodic scheduled or unscheduled inspections by the FDA.",
        "start_character": 78312,
        "end_character": 78406
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001464521-26-000042",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001464521-26-000042-e76fb86f52c94263",
        "accession_number": "0001464521-26-000042",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-18",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "To expand adoption, we are actively educating physicians on the AHA and ACC chest pain guidelines that support CCTA plus Heartflow FFRCT Analysis as the preferred pathway for diagnosis and management of CAD.",
        "start_character": 23989,
        "end_character": 24196
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001464521-26-000042",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001464521-26-000042-e76fb86f52c94263",
        "accession_number": "0001464521-26-000042",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-18",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We also face competition from companies that have developed or are developing AI-based platforms that leverage CCTA to diagnose CAD, including earlier-stage companies such as Cleerly, Inc., Elucid Bioimaging Inc.",
        "start_character": 55954,
        "end_character": 56166
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001464521-26-000042",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001464521-26-000042-e76fb86f52c94263",
        "accession_number": "0001464521-26-000042",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-18",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We are continuing to invest in research and development efforts with the goal of driving improvements to the Heartflow Platform and expanding its applicability to additional disease states and patient populations.",
        "start_character": 51665,
        "end_character": 51878
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001464521-26-000042",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001464521-26-000042-e76fb86f52c94263",
        "accession_number": "0001464521-26-000042",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-18",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We designed our AI-powered software platform to be highly scalable, seamlessly integrate into existing physician workflows for diagnosing CAD, and improve as we ingest more data over time.",
        "start_character": 4012,
        "end_character": 4200
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001464521-26-000042",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001464521-26-000042-e76fb86f52c94263",
        "accession_number": "0001464521-26-000042",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-18",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We have developed a highly scalable, capital efficient commercial model that combines TSMs who drive new account adoption with Territory Account Managers (“TAMs”) who focus on increasing utilization by educating referring physicians.",
        "start_character": 48064,
        "end_character": 48297
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001464521-26-000042",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001464521-26-000042-e76fb86f52c94263",
        "accession_number": "0001464521-26-000042",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-18",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We have developed and implemented processes designed to comply with HIPAA and are continuing to assess the need for additional safeguards, policies, procedures, and programing and to develop them where necessary.",
        "start_character": 106345,
        "end_character": 106557
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001464521-26-000042",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001464521-26-000042-e76fb86f52c94263",
        "accession_number": "0001464521-26-000042",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-18",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We have invested significantly in research and development efforts over more than a decade to establish the first and most widely adopted AI-enabled non-invasive test for CAD that is authorized for marketing in the United States.",
        "start_character": 50603,
        "end_character": 50832
      }
